('2521.mp4', 'People: person. Objects: streetlight, buildings, smartphone, road, bollards. Actions: standing, holding. Emotions: solitude, calm. Scenes: urban, night. Concepts: isolation, technology, tranquility', 'People: person. Objects: streetlight, buildings, smartphone, road, bollards. Actions: standing, hold...', 'person, streetlight, buildings, smartphone, road, bollards, standing, holding, solitude, calm, urban, night, isolation, technology, tranquility', 'A solitary figure stands under a streetlight on a quiet city street at night, holding up a smartphone that emits a bright light. Tall buildings loom in the background, their windows illuminated sporadically.', 'A solitary figure stands under a streetlight on a quiet urban street at night. Tall buildings with illuminated windows form the backdrop, casting a serene yet mysterious atmosphere. The warm glow of the streetlight highlights the person, creating a dramatic contrast against the dark surroundings.', NULL, '1080x1920', '9:16', 30.0, '5s'),
('2522.mp4', 'Animals: cat, birds. Nature: iceberg, ocean, sunset, sky. Objects: electric guitar. Actions: playing guitar, flying. Emotions: whimsical, serene. Scenes: surreal, oceanic, dreamlike, fantasy, nature. Concepts: fantasy, imagination, music, surrealism', 'Animals: cat, birds. Nature: iceberg, ocean, sunset, sky. Objects: electric guitar. Actions: playing...', 'cat, birds, iceberg, ocean, sunset, sky, electric guitar, playing guitar, flying, whimsical, serene, surreal, oceanic, dreamlike, fantasy, nature, fantasy, imagination, music, surrealism', 'A fluffy cat sits on an iceberg in the middle of the ocean, holding a blue electric guitar. The sky is painted with vibrant hues of orange and pink as the sun sets, casting a warm glow over the scene.', 'A fluffy cat sits on an iceberg, strumming a blue electric guitar against a vibrant sunset backdrop. The sky is painted with warm hues of orange and pink, while birds fly across the horizon. The scene combines elements of whimsy and serenity, creating a surreal atmosphere.', 'A cat sits on a floating iceberg, playing an electric guitar against a vibrant sunset sky. Birds fly overhead, adding to the surreal and whimsical atmosphere of the scene.', '1080x1920', '9:16', 30.0, '10s'),
