('2525.mp4', 'People: lips. Nature: trees, forest. Objects: makeup. Actions: artistic representation. Emotions: intensity. Scenes: close-up, artistic. Concepts: creativity, nature, art, fire', 'People: lips. Nature: trees, forest. Objects: makeup. Actions: artistic representation. Emotions: in...', 'lips, trees, forest, makeup, artistic representation, intensity, close-up, artistic, creativity, nature, art, fire', 'A close-up of lips painted with a striking design resembling a forest fire. The upper lip features silhouettes of trees against a fiery orange background, while the lower lip depicts flames in vivid reds and oranges.', 'A close-up of lips painted with a striking design resembling a forest fire. The upper lip features silhouettes of trees, while the lower lip displays vibrant, fiery colors mimicking flames.', NULL, '1088x1888', '34:59', 30.0, '5s'),
